 "widget": {"name": "length"}, "link": null}], "outputs": [{"localized_name": "positive", "name": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING", "links": [32]}, {"localized_name": "Latent", "name": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "links": [30, 37]}], "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.35.1", "Node name for S&R": "MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo"}, "widgets_values": ["For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Photoreal cinematic space opera with detailed metal surfaces, cold hard starlight, restrained film grain and a near-black void. The opening composition and ship designs come directly from the first frame. A rust-and-cyan nebula lies far behind the battle; orange detonations and ion-blue engines illuminate the gunmetal hulls. The camera tracks right along the battle line, creating strong separation between nearby ships and distant formations. Warships cross on intersecting paths, their solid silhouettes moving independently of the long exhaust trails behind them.\nA salvo of missiles accelerates between the larger ships, leaving narrow luminous trails that curve toward one cruiser. The cruiser raises a translucent blue energy shield. Several impacts spread bright concentric ripples over its surface; the shield flexes inward, then holds, and the ship banks away while its engines flare. Nearby, a turquoise laser punches through a different frigate. A bright exit flash bursts from its opposite side before the hull breaks into a few large recognisable sections and a spray of smaller fragments. The wreckage continues along the frigate's original direction instead of hanging motionless at the explosion centre.\nThe camera carries on past the engagement. A damaged ship tilts across the foreground, venting white jets and scattering sparks from an open seam. Its broken surface passes close enough for individual armour plates to remain readable. An expanding orange shock front reaches adjacent ships, making them rock before their engines correct their heading. Fresh laser fire crosses behind them while missile trails peel away deeper into the battlefield. Near objects cross quickly; the distant nebula remains a stable spatial anchor.\nBy the end, the foreground wreck has cleared the central view. The continuing battle occupies the lower and outer frame, leaving a darker region of starfield ahead for the next event. The fleet remains in motion, but this local passage through the wreckage has completed. There is no dialogue or visible writing.\n\noverall_soundscape: Layered impacts and muffled explosions resonate through a metallic hull perspective, with intermittent alarm pulses, stressed-metal groans and sharp fragment strikes. Missile passes rise above this low rumble, and each shield impact adds an abrasive high squeal followed by a bass vibration. The nearest wreck produces a short tearing-metal sound before the broader battle recedes slightly.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A", 1344, 768, 192]}, {"id": 11, "type": "CreateVideo", "pos": [2680, 60], "size": [270, 126], "flags": {}, "order": 13, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"localized_name": "图像", "name": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "link": 25}, {"localized_name": "音频", "name": "audio", "shape": 7, "type": "AUDIO", "link": 26}, {"localized_name": "帧率", "name": "fps", "type": "FLOAT", "widget": {"name": "fps"}, "link": null}, {"localized_name": "bit_depth", "name": "bit_depth", "shape": 7, "type": "COMBO", "widget": {"name": "bit_depth"}, "link": null}, {"localized_name": "color_space", "name": "color_space", "shape": 7, "type": "COMBO", "widget": {"name": "color_space"}, "link": null}], "outputs": [{"localized_name": "视频", "name": "VIDEO", "type": "VIDEO", "links": [27]}], "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.35.1", "Node name for S&R": "CreateVideo"}, "widgets_values": [24, "auto", "sRGB"]}, {"id": 12, "type": "SaveVideo", "pos": [3060, 60], "size": [270, 130], "flags": {}, "order